  "project_description": "Provides a Supported Image field formatter that displays one or more specific deltas (values) from the field. Adapted from and based on the Image Delta Formatter project.\n\n Enable the included Responsive Supported Image Delta Formatter sub-module for responsive image style support.\n\n Dependencies \n \n Supported Image \n Image Delta Formatter \n \n Post-installation \n \n Go to the \"Manage display\" page of your entity type and change your image field's display formatter to \"Image delta\". \n Click the gear icon near the formatter to configure which image style should be used (if any) and which values (deltas) should be displayed through it. \n Save the display formatter settings. \n \n Supporting this module \n You can support this module by helping out in our issue queue . Report bugs, feature requests, or other issues, and propose resolutions via merge requests or patches.\n\n Back to top",
